<title>HUNGARY: Danubius group '96 pre-tax profit 2.67 bln.</title>
<headline>Danubius group '96 pre-tax profit 2.67 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Jan-Dec 1996    Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	    2,347.6    vs  1,678.7</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		2,665.5    vs  2,056.9</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    10,181.3    vs  7,434.2</p>
<p>    Group other revenue		   115.0    vs    133.0</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	     2,698.6    vs  1,917.3</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	    2,902.5    vs  2,314.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    633.3    vs    380.3</p>
<p>    Other costs			   1,216.0    vs    903.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		    506.9    vs    388.8</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    226.1 profit vs 392.4 profit</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue		  500.0    vs    450.3</p>
<p>	 Financial expenditures	   273.9    vs     57.9</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	     91.8 profit vs 14.1 loss</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary revenue	    234.8    vs     63.2</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary expenditure	143.0    vs     77.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Danubius Hotels is a hotel chain.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom  +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
